    "Read-only fingerprints public tables/Auth.users/Auth.identities/Storage.objects stable before/after retention and before stop. Auth audit/session cleanup tables are not falsely declared immutable.",
    "Storage source-before/source-after/private-copy hashes equal; reject links/special files and any PG raw-data copying.",
    "Complete private checkpoint and every retained file digest, bound to controller/plan hashes; all six dumps must PASS before any stop.",
    "Unreadable directory enumeration fails closed; all retained file/directory entries fsynced before the complete private checkpoint. Process start probes use TZ=Etc/UTC and locale C.",
    "Two exact isolated application copies CI5+CI6: own core revision, manifest/source bytes, private env digest and BUILD_ID checked before/after retention and before stop; archive only declared sources and build ID metadata, without node_modules or .next binaries."
  ],
